Ht9050DryRun.cpp W906_Ht9050DryRunOn: besides the MachineType.h define, Gerneral.ini [System] W906_HT9050DryRun must be 1 (read once per run); missing / 0 = the Type_HT9050 production flow. MachineType.h untouched (no full rebuild); back to the dry run = set it to 1 and restart. tests/test_ht9050_prodflow.cpp: the SHIP expectation follows the ini. HT9050_ProdFlow, HT9050_DryRun passed. Release linked; Debug compiled (link waits for EastSun's program). WORKLOG row 182.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 Ht9050DryRun.cpp               | 2 +-
 docs/WORKLOG_MACHINE.md        | 1 +
 tests/test_ht9050_prodflow.cpp | 2 +-
 3 files changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Ht9050DryRun.cpp b/Ht9050DryRun.cpp
index 7e518f7..89a599c 100644
--- a/Ht9050DryRun.cpp
+++ b/Ht9050DryRun.cpp
@@ -428,7 +428,7 @@ void StepTick()
 bool W906_Ht9050DryRunOn()
 {
 #if defined(W906_HT9050_DRYRUN) && !defined(SOFT_SIMULTE)   //AI(W906-HT9050-PRODFLOW) 20261005: NB2-1 R233, Jimmy 1005 16:2x / 16:4x (to NB2, URGENT U23)「把空跑關掉，改跑 Frank 的正式流程…除非機台端要求修改空跑功能，不然就是修正式流程」＋「機台端不要影響，讓Eastsun決定要不要開起空跑」: the SIMULATION build (SOFT_SIMULTE: dev PCs, NB2, ctest SIM) never lets the dry run own DoAllProcess -> an HT9050 START runs the Type_HT9050 production flow; the machine build (no SOFT_SIMULTE) is unchanged -- EastSun keeps MachineType.h W906_HT9050_DRYRUN on or comments it out. ctest HT9050_ProdFlow
-    return W906_Ht9050OrgHome(MTrayX) != -2;
+    static int s_w906DryIni = -1;  if (s_w906DryIni < 0) s_w906DryIni = (int)::GetPrivateProfileIntA("System", "W906_HT9050DryRun", 0, "D:\\HT9045\\system\\Gerneral.ini");  if (s_w906DryIni == 0) return false;   /* AI(W906-PRODSWITCH) 20261007: EastSun 1007「我現在要測試 9050 正常流程 請切換流程」-- the dry run also needs Gerneral.ini [System] W906_HT9050DryRun=1 (read once per run); missing / 0 = the Type_HT9050 production flow. Switching back = set it to 1 and restart, no rebuild */  return W906_Ht9050OrgHome(MTrayX) != -2;
 #else
     return false;
 #endif
